\section1 What Comes Next?

The game is still lacking some major features, you can:
\list
\li Add background music and game sound effects
\li Add more enemies like archers or mages
\li Add more attack styles like dash strike, or ranged combat
\li Add more blessings and curses
\li Expand the map generation to different strutures
\li Add traps, treasure chests, an inventory, item pickups, multiple weapons, ...
\endlist
There are so much more ideas which can be implemented.